USER Setup custom authentication for litellm.
USER * Add an option to define users in the litellm configuration ("lite-llm/config.nix"). The key *is not* part of these options. 
USER * The launch wrapper, defined in "lite-llm/setup.nix", will check the list of defined users and generate random keys before starting
