USER * A custom litellm authenticator will be defined based on the users and credentials. The authenticator
USER   will check if the request matches a known user and key.
USER * The litellm runtime runtime configuration, generated in "lite-llm/setup.nix", must enable the authenticator.
USER   Note that that requires that the authenticator reside in the same directory as the yaml configuration.
USER 
USER ```
