ASSISTANT - Key generation goes in the wrapper right after `api-key-setup`: `mkdir -p "$DEVTOOLS_CONFIG/users"`, then per user, if `$DEVTOOLS_CONFIG/users/<user>.key` is missing, write `openssl rand -hex 32` to it (plus `chmod 600`). Existing files are never touched → keys are reused across launches.
