ASSISTANT       --config "${lite-llm-config-dir}/config.yml" \
ASSISTANT       --port "${toString lite-llm.port}"
ASSISTANT ```
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT ## 3. Example + verification
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT Add a user to the example instance:
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT ```nix
