ASSISTANT     mkdir -p "$out"
ASSISTANT     cp "${lite-llm-config-yml}" "$out/config.yml"
ASSISTANT     cp "${custom-auth}" "$out/custom_auth.py"
ASSISTANT   '';
ASSISTANT ```
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT **e. Key generation** — create-once semantics, so keys are reused across launches:
ASSISTANT 
