ASSISTANT ## Verification
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT 1. Launch twice — `$DEVTOOLS_CONFIG/users/alice.key` created once (64 hex chars, mode 600), untouched on relaunch.
ASSISTANT 2. No/wrong bearer token → 401; `Authorization: Bearer $(< .../users/alice.key)` → proxied request.
